38036>>>>>>
38036>>>>>        Else Begin
38037>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to True
38038>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to True
38039>>>>>            WebSet pbRender of oDeleteBtn to bHasRecord
38040>>>>>        End
38040>>>>>>
38040>>>>>    End_Procedure
